  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, you carry a pool of repair nanites represented by a pool of <strong>d6 dice equal to twice your Intelligence modifier</strong> (minimum of 2 dice).</p>\n<p>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you project nanites at a Construct, object, structure, or vehicle within <strong>30 feet</strong>. Spend any number of dice from your pool up to your Proficiency Bonus. Roll the dice: the target regains hit points equal to the total rolled. If the target is your Automaton, you can also reduce its <strong>Heat by an amount equal to the total rolled</strong>.</p>\n<p>You regain all expended Rapid Repair dice when you finish a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p>",
